{#- Name the stems (Signature): small rings on this week's photograph; tap one to see what it is. "Name the stems"
    shows every name at once. Drawn by the script over the photo (rings are placed on the photograph as it is cropped),
    so nothing shows without JavaScript or when the photo isn't the one the stems were marked on. -#}
<div class="fl-nts" data-feature="name-the-stems" data-js-only>
  <ul class="fl-nts-l" role="list" aria-label="Stems in this week's flowers" data-stems-list></ul>
  <button type="button" class="fl-nts-all" aria-pressed="false" data-stems-all>Name the stems</button>
</div>
